Note on Dataset:
The EPA Toxics Release Inventory (TRI) data used in this project is publicly
available through the United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) and
is not subject to copyright restrictions. It is freely available at:
https://www.epa.gov/toxics-release-inventory-tri-program/tri-basic-data-files-calendar-years-1987-present

Users of this software are responsible for ensuring compliance with the EPA's
data usage terms and any applicable regulations.
